  "year": 2024,
  "arxivId": "2410.18982",
  "abstract": "This paper introduces a pioneering approach to artificial intelligence research, embodied in our O1 Replication Journey. We aim to replicate the capabilities of OpenAI's O1 model while reimagining the process of conducting and communicating AI research. Our methodology addresses critical challenges in modern AI research, including the insularity of prolonged team-based projects and the lack of recognition for diverse contributions. We propose a new paradigm called 'journey learning,' which encourages models to learn not just shortcuts, but the complete exploration process, including trial and error, reflection, and backtracking.",
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "The Core Idea",
      "content": "The O1 Replication Journey is a transparent, real-time exploration to replicate the capabilities of OpenAI's O1 model. Our primary goal is not to achieve performance parity with O1, but to document and share our exploration process, focusing on fundamental questions, trial-and-error experiences, and the broader AI community. <strong>Journey learning</strong> is a new paradigm that encourages models to learn the complete exploration process, including trial and error, reflection, and backtracking.",
