    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "Journey learning is designed to enable AI systems to progress continuously through learning, reflection, backtracking, and adaptation. This approach aims to create AI systems that are not just narrow, task-specific tools, but adaptable, reasoning entities capable of handling the nuances and complexities of real-world challenges. <strong>Long thought construction</strong> is a key component of journey learning, which involves constructing long thoughts with actions like reflection and backtracking.",
