    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "Our journey learning approach has outperformed conventional supervised learning by over 8% on the MATH dataset, demonstrating its powerful potential. We believe this to be the most crucial component of O1 technology that we have successfully decoded. <strong>Long thought data</strong> is a critical aspect of journey learning, which involves constructing long thoughts that encompass actions like backtracking and reflection.",
